TI  - No evidence for immune priming in ants exposed to a fungal pathogen
AN  - 22523588
DO  - 10.1371/journal.pone.0035372
IS  - 4
VL  - 7
DA  - 2012
PY  - 2012
JO  - PloS one
J2  - PLoS One
SN  - 1932-6203
